{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33177","headline":"自渭南晚次华州 · 司马扎","name":"自渭南晚次华州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前楼仙鼎原，西经赤水渡。\n火云入村巷，余雨依驿树。\n我行伤去国，疲马屡回顾。\n有如无窠鸟，触热不得住。\n峨峨华峰近，城郭生夕雾。\n逆旅何人寻，行客暗中住。\n却思林丘卧，自惬平生素。\n劳役今若兹，羞吟招隐句。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}